<title>USA: Donegal hurricane losses $0.05/shr in Q3.</title>
<headline>Donegal hurricane losses $0.05/shr in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>MARIETTA, Pa. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donegal Group Inc said on Friday that losses from Hurricane Fran will total $300,000 before taxes in the third quarter, or $0.05 per share.</p>
<p>The majority of losses were in Virginia and resulted from high winds and heavy rains, the company said.</p>
<p>The regional property-casualty insurer said it would report third quarter results November 1.</p>
</text>
